<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>회원탈퇴 - OliveMe</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #fffde6;
            font-family: 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .delete-box {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            width: 360px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .desc {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .delete-btn {
            background-color: #e57373;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .delete-btn:hover {
            background-color: #d85c5c;
        }

        .cancel-btn {
            background-color: #b9df9f;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }

        .cancel-btn:hover {
            background-color: #a6ce8f;
        }

        .error {
            color: red;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="delete-box">
        <h2>회원탈퇴</h2>

        <p class="desc">
            회원탈퇴를 진행하면 계정 정보가 삭제됩니다.<br>
            본인 확인을 위해 비밀번호를 입력해주세요.
        </p>

        <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="/delete-account" method="POST">
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호 입력" required>

            <button type="submit" class="delete-btn"
                onclick="return confirm('정말 회원탈퇴를 진행하시겠습니까?');">
                탈퇴하기
            </button>

            <button type="button" class="cancel-btn" onclick="location.href='/mypage'">
                취소
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>